---
// Footer — new design with two-column layout
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-left">
      <h3 class="footer-brand">KI Norge</h3>
      <p class="footer-description">
        Et tverrsektorielt samarbeid for å fremme ansvarlig og sikker bruk av kunstig intelligens i den norske forvaltningen.
      </p>
      <div class="footer-social">
        <a href="#" class="footer-social-icon" aria-label="Instagram">
          <div class="social-circle"><img class="social-icon" src="/Instagram.svg" alt="Instagram" /></div>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="footer-social-icon" aria-label="LinkedIn">
          <div class="social-circle"><img class="social-icon" src="/LinkenIn.svg" alt="LinkedIn" /></div>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="footer-social-icon" aria-label="X">
          <div class="social-circle"><img class="social-icon" src="/X.svg" alt="X" /></div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-right">
      <div class="footer-nav-col">
        <a href="/om-oss" class="footer-nav-link">Om KI Norge</a>
        <a href="/kontakt" class="footer-nav-link">Kontakt</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-nav-col">
        <a href="/personvern" class="footer-nav-link">Personvern og informasjonskapsler</a>
        <a href="/tilgjengelighet" class="footer-nav-link">Tilgjengelighet</a>
        <button type="button" class="footer-nav-link footer-nav-button">Endre samtykke for informasjonskapsler</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      #cedbfb 0%,
      #d8cef5 30%,
      #e8d5f0 50%,
      #d4c8eb 70%,
      #cedbfb 100%
    );
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 64px 120px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .footer-inner {
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 120px;
    }
  }

  .footer-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
    color: #000;
  }

  .footer-description {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 360px;
  }

  .footer-social {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .footer-social-icon {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .social-circle {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .social-circle:hover {
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    fill: #fff;
    stroke: #fff;
  }

  .social-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    margin: 6px;
  }

  .footer-right {
    display: flex;
    gap: 48px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .footer-right {
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }

  .footer-nav-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .footer-nav-link {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #000;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .footer-nav-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .footer-nav-button {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
</style>
